    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/f8377c8b6bb7169bf908317b3b8af175.poster.avif?t=1749830048\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/f8377c8b6bb7169bf908317b3b8af175.webm?t=1749830048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/f8377c8b6bb7169bf908317b3b8af175.mp4?t=1749830048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, build, and battle your way through a magical hand-drawn world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Gombo, you\u2019ll dive into a vibrant adventure where survival, creativity, and action go hand in hand. Whether venturing out solo or teaming up in seamless peer-to-peer two-player co-op, you\u2019ll uncover a world full of mystery, danger, and charm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/3720af8cc130a66025a4258c2623772a.poster.avif?t=1749830048\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/3720af8cc130a66025a4258c2623772a.webm?t=1749830048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/3720af8cc130a66025a4258c2623772a.mp4?t=1749830048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather Resources and Craft Everything you need to Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore lush forests, haunted woods and dungeons full resources to fuel your survival. Use what you find to craft everything from powerful weapons to handy tools and helpful utilities. Build shelters, outposts, and full-on homesteads wherever your journey takes you. Set up farms, grow your own crops, and transform wild terrain into a place to call home. Care for your pets and take them on a ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/fb5e8cbdef1c45c48ac98ac4b7ba8063.poster.avif?t=1749830048\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/fb5e8cbdef1c45c48ac98ac4b7ba8063.webm?t=1749830048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/fb5e8cbdef1c45c48ac98ac4b7ba8063.mp4?t=1749830048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Ferocious Enemies and Colossal Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Gombo may look playful, but danger lurks around every corner. Face off against a wide range of imaginative creatures, cunning elite foes, and massive bosses that will test your skills. Harness magical powers and unlock transformative abilities to turn the tide of battle and keep the chaos at bay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/8178962a526aa91c7f14b84092a0fc14.poster.avif?t=1749830048\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/8178962a526aa91c7f14b84092a0fc14.webm?t=1749830048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/8178962a526aa91c7f14b84092a0fc14.mp4?t=1749830048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living World Full of Stories and Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gombo\u2019s world is alive with detail, brimming with dynamic biomes, hand-crafted dungeons, and a day and night cycles. Embark on a journey to uncover the mysteries of these enchanted lands, take on quirky sidequests, and meet a colorful cast of characters eager to lend a hand - or stir up trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/4c1ec71bfc095ea34551cdaf58bf1fd4.poster.avif?t=1749830048\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/4c1ec71bfc095ea34551cdaf58bf1fd4.webm?t=1749830048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/4c1ec71bfc095ea34551cdaf58bf1fd4.mp4?t=1749830048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play It Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character from head to toe and find a wide range of outfits and styles on your travels. Play at your own pace - solo or with a friend in smooth peer-to-peer online co-op. Gombo supports controllers and is optimized for Steam Deck, making it easy to jump into the adventure however and wherever you want.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/f8377c8b6bb7169bf908317b3b8af175.poster.avif?t=1749830048\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/f8377c8b6bb7169bf908317b3b8af175.webm?t=1749830048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/f8377c8b6bb7169bf908317b3b8af175.mp4?t=1749830048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, build, and battle your way through a magical hand-drawn world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Gombo, you\u2019ll dive into a vibrant adventure where survival, creativity, and action go hand in hand. Whether venturing out solo or teaming up in seamless peer-to-peer two-player co-op, you\u2019ll uncover a world full of mystery, danger, and charm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/3720af8cc130a66025a4258c2623772a.poster.avif?t=1749830048\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/3720af8cc130a66025a4258c2623772a.webm?t=1749830048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/3720af8cc130a66025a4258c2623772a.mp4?t=1749830048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather Resources and Craft Everything you need to Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore lush forests, haunted woods and dungeons full resources to fuel your survival. Use what you find to craft everything from powerful weapons to handy tools and helpful utilities. Build shelters, outposts, and full-on homesteads wherever your journey takes you. Set up farms, grow your own crops, and transform wild terrain into a place to call home. Care for your pets and take them on a ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/fb5e8cbdef1c45c48ac98ac4b7ba8063.poster.avif?t=1749830048\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/fb5e8cbdef1c45c48ac98ac4b7ba8063.webm?t=1749830048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/fb5e8cbdef1c45c48ac98ac4b7ba8063.mp4?t=1749830048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Ferocious Enemies and Colossal Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Gombo may look playful, but danger lurks around every corner. Face off against a wide range of imaginative creatures, cunning elite foes, and massive bosses that will test your skills. Harness magical powers and unlock transformative abilities to turn the tide of battle and keep the chaos at bay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/8178962a526aa91c7f14b84092a0fc14.poster.avif?t=1749830048\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/8178962a526aa91c7f14b84092a0fc14.webm?t=1749830048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/8178962a526aa91c7f14b84092a0fc14.mp4?t=1749830048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living World Full of Stories and Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gombo\u2019s world is alive with detail, brimming with dynamic biomes, hand-crafted dungeons, and a day and night cycles. Embark on a journey to uncover the mysteries of these enchanted lands, take on quirky sidequests, and meet a colorful cast of characters eager to lend a hand - or stir up trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/4c1ec71bfc095ea34551cdaf58bf1fd4.poster.avif?t=1749830048\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/4c1ec71bfc095ea34551cdaf58bf1fd4.webm?t=1749830048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649860/extras/4c1ec71bfc095ea34551cdaf58bf1fd4.mp4?t=1749830048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play It Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character from head to toe and find a wide range of outfits and styles on your travels. Play at your own pace - solo or with a friend in smooth peer-to-peer online co-op. Gombo supports controllers and is optimized for Steam Deck, making it easy to jump into the adventure however and wherever you want.</p>",
    "short_description": "Explore, craft, fight, build and survive in a mysterious cartoon world! Take control of Gombo, an enchanted creature and dive into an adventure full of magic. Play alone or in online co-op with a friend. Can you uncover the dark secrets of this colorful realm?",
